#: includes/class-gf-zero-spam-ai-review-settings.php:239
msgid "Zero Spam blocks most spam with an invisible token check before AI is involved. Turn on the tools below to let AI handle the edge cases — catching spam that slips past, or rescuing real submissions blocked by mistake. Both use the same instructions and the same {{link}}AI service{{/link}}."
