msgstr ""

#: includes/class-gf-zero-spam-ai-review-settings.php:299
msgid "If the token check blocks a submission but the content looks genuine, AI can let it through. Only submissions blocked by Zero Spam's token check are eligible; during a token-failure flood this can increase AI usage."
msgstr ""

